    gmeow:howToUse "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:imageOrientation, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:imageOrientation and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:imageOrientation (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:imageOrientationFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:imageOrientation ."@x-gmeow-english ;
